# Repo-root build context (backend image). Nothing listed here reaches the
# Docker daemon, which keeps builds fast and the image small.
#
# v2: added design-references/ and HAP_ext/ — Gate 0 measured 14 MB of the
# 15.8 MB context as dead weight from these two.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Built by its own image — never ship React source or node_modules here.
frontend/

# Reference material and screenshots: not needed to serve the API.
design-references/
HAP_ext/
docs/
PDF_Rebadging failures/

# Desktop app tests and fixtures.
tests/
test/
**/tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Sample drawings and reports — hundreds of MB, never needed at runtime.
samples/
fixtures/
**/*.pdf
**/*.xlsx
**/*.csv
!config/**/*.csv

# Secrets must never be baked into an image layer. Both project env files.
.env
.env.*
!.env.maec.example

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.log
venv/
.venv/

*.md
!README.md
dist/
build/
